#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:183
msgid "On processors with a single CCD (such as the Ryzen 7 7800X3D or 9800X3D) every core already has the cache, and processors without 3D V-Cache have nothing to choose. There the driver is absent, and BiGame-mode shows the option as not supported instead of a control that would do nothing."
msgstr "Na procesoroch s jedným CCD (ako Ryzen 7 7800X3D alebo 9800X3D) má vyrovnávaciu pamäť už každé jadro a procesory bez 3D V-Cache nemajú z čoho vyberať. Tam ovládač chýba a BiGame-mode zobrazí voľbu ako nepodporovanú namiesto ovládacieho prvku, ktorý by nič nerobil."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:162
