msgstr "Zmena sa zastavila bez odpovede. Príčinu nájdete v sekcii Záznamy."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2840
msgid "The choice for this game is not saved. Saving keeps it for the next time; nothing is installed either way."
msgstr "Voľba pre túto hru nie je uložená. Uložením sa zachová na budúce; v žiadnom prípade sa nič neinštaluje."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2383
msgid "The choice was not saved"
msgstr "Voľba nebola uložená"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:370
msgid "The connection and a DNS comparison, programs competing for the CPU, and Steam launch options that call a missing program."
msgstr "Pripojenie a porovnanie DNS, programy súperiace o CPU a možnosti spustenia Steam, ktoré volajú chýbajúci program."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/dns_config.rs:607
msgid "The connection to the internet (%s) is not managed by NetworkManager"
msgstr "Pripojenie na internet (%s) nespravuje NetworkManager"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2200
msgid "The current version stays one click away. Updating while a version works is your choice."
msgstr "Aktuálna verzia zostáva na jedno kliknutie. Aktualizovať, kým verzia funguje, je vaša voľba."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:735
msgid "The file Heroic keeps this game's settings in. When you save, BiGame-mode writes the game's own Gamescope, Wine FSR and vkBasalt there (with Heroic closed, after keeping a copy of your file) and later takes out only what it wrote; the rest is yours."
msgstr "Súbor, v ktorom Heroic uchováva nastavenia tejto hry. Pri uložení doň BiGame-mode zapíše vlastný Gamescope, Wine FSR a vkBasalt hry (pri zatvorenom Heroic, po vytvorení kópie vášho súboru) a neskôr odstráni iba to, čo sám zapísal; zvyšok je váš."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/launch.rs:264
msgid "The file as you left it, or vkBasalt's example when there is none. Choosing it after a look puts your file back."
msgstr "Súbor tak, ako ste ho nechali, alebo príklad vkBasalt, keď žiadny nie je. Zvolením po nejakom štýle sa vráti váš súbor."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:204
msgid "The game card"
msgstr "Karta hry"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2146
