msgid "Turbo is falcond's service, as systemd reports it: on means enabled and running, off means stopped. Nothing is claimed that systemd does not confirm."
msgstr "Turbo je služba falcond tak, ako ju hlási systemd: zapnuté znamená povolená a spustená, vypnuté znamená zastavená. Netvrdí sa nič, čo systemd nepotvrdí."

