#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:373 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:71
msgid "falcond profile set"
msgstr "Sada profilov falcond"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:264
msgid "falcond recognises a game by the name of its process, as the system monitor shows it, not by its title. When a game without a profile starts with Turbo on, BiGame-mode can offer to create one."
msgstr "falcond rozpozná hru podľa názvu jej procesu, ako ho ukazuje monitor systému, nie podľa jej titulu. Keď sa hra bez profilu spustí so zapnutým Turbo, BiGame-mode môže ponúknuť jeho vytvorenie."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:546
msgid "falcond recognises the game by the name of its process (as the system monitor shows it), not by its title. A profile under another name never applies."
msgstr "falcond rozpoznáva hru podľa názvu jej procesu (ako ho zobrazuje monitor systému), nie podľa jej titulu. Profil pod iným názvom sa nikdy nepoužije."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:166
msgid "falcond restarts"
msgstr "Reštarty falcond"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:1142
msgid "falcond sees a game start at once, from the kernel's process events. The scan is its safety net: every so many milliseconds, once no process has started for that long, it reads the process list again, which catches a game whose name changes after it starts. 9000 ms (9 s) is falcond's default; lower costs a little CPU for nothing on most machines."
msgstr "falcond zaznamená spustenie hry okamžite, z udalostí procesov jadra. Prehľadávanie je jeho poistka: každých toľko milisekúnd, keď sa tak dlho nespustil žiadny proces, znova prečíta zoznam procesov, čím zachytí hru, ktorej názov sa po spustení zmení. 9000 ms (9 s) je predvolená hodnota falcond; nižšia stojí na väčšine počítačov trochu CPU zbytočne."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/booster/plan.rs:266
msgid "falcond sets it for each game from the game's profile; when the game exits it puts back the profile that was in use when falcond started, not one chosen later"
msgstr "falcond ho nastavuje pre každú hru z profilu hry; po ukončení hry vráti profil, ktorý sa používal pri spustení falcond, nie neskôr zvolený"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/info.rs:203
msgid "falcond ships ready-made profiles for well-known games, in three sets. The set decides which of them falcond uses; the profiles you make here apply in every set. falcond reloads its profiles after a change."
msgstr "falcond obsahuje hotové profily pre známe hry v troch sadách. Sada určuje, ktoré z nich falcond použije; profily, ktoré vytvoríte tu, platia v každej sade. falcond po zmene svoje profily znova načíta."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:91
msgid "falcond ships separate profile sets for desktops, handhelds and home-theatre PCs. The handheld set runs games in power-saving mode, which is the wrong set for a desktop."
msgstr "falcond dodáva samostatné sady profilov pre stolné počítače, handheldy a počítače pre domáce kino. Sada pre handheldy spúšťa hry v úspornom režime, čo je pre stolný počítač nesprávna sada."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/app.rs:314
msgid "falcond stopped unexpectedly"
msgstr "falcond sa neočakávane zastavil"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:231
msgid "falcond then gives no game the performance profile. Turn it on in Tuning → Performance."
msgstr "falcond potom žiadnej hre nedá profil napájania performance. Zapnite ho v Ladenie → Výkon."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:324
msgid "falcond will apply it the next time the game starts."
msgstr "falcond ho použije pri ďalšom spustení hry."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:220
msgid "falcond writes its status to /var/lib/falcond/status (or /tmp/falcond_status). The file is missing, or not owned by root, so nothing is trusted from it."
msgstr "falcond zapisuje svoj stav do /var/lib/falcond/status (alebo /tmp/falcond_status). Súbor chýba alebo ho nevlastní root, takže sa mu nedôveruje."

